---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="時值 · 把你的人生，算清楚。" description="財務理清楚，未來不迷路。台灣人專屬的個人財務規劃工具，收支、資產、目標、退休一頁全覽。免費版永久可用，無需信用卡。">
  <Nav />

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">台灣人專屬的個人財務規劃工具</div>
    <h1>把你的人生，<em>算清楚。</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">財務理清楚，未來不迷路。</p>
    <p class="hero-sub">收支、資產、退休、目標——一頁全覽。讓每一個財務決定都有數字支撐，不再靠感覺猜未來。</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="/app.html#login" class="btn-primary">免費開始使用</a>
      <a href="#features" class="btn-ghost">了解功能 ↓</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">免費版永久可用 · 無需信用卡 · 登入後資料雲端同步</p>

    <div class="hero-preview">
      <div class="preview-bar">
        <div class="preview-dot" style="background:#FF5F57"></div>
        <div class="preview-dot" style="background:#FFBD2E"></div>
        <div class="preview-dot" style="background:#28C840"></div>
        <div style="flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">valuelens.tw/</div>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-mock">
        <div class="mock-nav">
          <div class="mock-nav-item active"></div>
          <div class="mock-nav-item" style="opacity:.5"></div>
          <div class="mock-nav-item" style="opacity:.4"></div>
          <div class="mock-nav-item" style="opacity:.35"></div>
          <div class="mock-nav-item" style="opacity:.28"></div>
          <div class="mock-nav-item" style="opacity:.22"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-content">
          <div class="mock-card">
            <div class="mock-label">每月結餘</div>
            <div class="mock-value" style="color:var(--primary)">NT$28,000</div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-card">
            <div class="mock-label">目前淨值</div>
            <div class="mock-value">NT$3,200,000</div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-card wide">
            <div class="mock-label" style="position:relative;z-index:1">人生財務時間軸</div>
            <div class="mock-chart">
              <div class="mock-bar" style="height:20%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar" style="height:28%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar mid" style="height:38%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar mid" style="height:48%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar hi" style="height:60%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar hi" style="height:72%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar hi" style="height:82%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar hi" style="height:90%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar hi" style="height:85%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar mid" style="height:70%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar mid" style="height:55%"></div>
              <div class="mock-bar" style="height:38%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PAIN POINTS -->
  <section class="pain">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">你也有這些問題嗎？</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">財務規劃，從來都不簡單</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-grid">
        <div class="pain-card">
          <div class="pain-icon">🏠</div>
          <div class="pain-q">「我到底幾年後才能買房？」</div>
          <div class="pain-a">頭期款、房貸、日常開銷——時值幫你算清楚每月需要存多少、幾年達標，不再是模糊的「努力就對了」。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-card">
          <div class="pain-icon">👴</div>
          <div class="pain-q">「我的退休金，夠活到幾歲？」</div>
          <div class="pain-a">用蒙地卡羅模擬跑 800 次情境，告訴你最壞狀況下資產能撐幾年，讓你提早看到危機。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-card">
          <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
          <div class="pain-q">「我每個月到底省哪裡了？」</div>
          <div class="pain-a">把所有收入、支出、貸款一次輸入，系統自動算出每月結餘、儲蓄率、資金緊繃的日子。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="feat-header">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">核心功能</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">一個工具，管好你的整個財務人生</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub" style="margin:0 auto">免費版包含基礎功能與三個試算工具，升級後解鎖更多進階模組。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-grid">
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5" rx="1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">人生財務時間軸</div>
            <div class="feat-desc">從現在到退休，每一年的資產預估一目了然。支援三情境模擬（保守/中性/樂觀）與 4% 法則退休目標線，讓你看到「夠」與「不夠」的分水嶺。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h10M4 17h13"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">收支管理與資金流量</div>
            <div class="feat-desc">記錄每月收入、固定支出、貸款，自動計算每日資金餘額——讓你知道哪幾天現金會告急，哪個月份是財務低谷。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">人生目標規劃</div>
            <div class="feat-desc">設定「買房」「出國讀書」「提早退休」等目標，系統自動計算每月需投入多少、幾年可達成，並告訴你現在的結餘夠不夠同時追多個目標。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">財務體檢報告</div>
            <div class="feat-desc">一鍵產生個人財務報告：儲蓄率、緊急預備金、退休準備度、目標可行性分析、具體行動建議——免費用戶可查看第一節現況體檢。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V8l7-4 7 4v13"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">勞退勞保試算</div>
            <div class="feat-desc">依台灣勞保老年年金公式與勞退個人專戶估算退休給付，自動計入你的人生財務時間軸，不再手動試算。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="M3.5 21v-2a5.5 5.5 0 0111 0v2"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="M16.5 21v-1a4 4 0 013.5-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">子女養育試算 <span class="badge-accent">完整版</span></div>
            <div class="feat-desc">從孕期到大學，細算托育、教育、才藝等費用，考量政府補貼（育嬰留停津貼），估算每位孩子的總養育成本與每月需準備的教育金。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8a8 8 0 0116 0C20 17.5 12 22 12 22z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">保險防護缺口 <span class="badge-accent">完整版</span></div>
            <div class="feat-desc">輸入所有保單明細，系統自動加總壽險保額、計算遺族需求缺口，並以時間軸圖呈現定期保單到期後保障下降的風險區間。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="feat-title">分期採購規劃 <span class="badge-accent">完整版</span></div>
            <div class="feat-desc">預設頭款比例、期數與利率，每筆大型採購（換車、裝潢、電器）自動計算月付金額，並即時反映到收支與資金流量裡。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE TOOLS -->
  <section class="tools-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">免費試算，不需登入</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">先算清楚，再決定要不要用</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub" style="margin:0 auto">公開試算工具，輸入數字即時看結果，資料不儲存、不需帳號。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tools-grid">
        <a href="/tools/postal-salary/" class="tool-card">
          <div class="tool-icon">📮</div>
          <div class="tool-name">中華郵政薪資試算</div>
          <div class="tool-desc">輸入薪級與職責層次，即時計算月薪、年薪成長曲線與職涯總收入。考郵局前必看。</div>
          <div class="tool-link">立即試算 →</div>
        </a>
        <div class="tool-card coming">
          <div class="tool-icon">🏦</div>
          <div class="tool-name">勞退自提試算 <span class="badge-soon">即將推出</span></div>
          <div class="tool-desc">計算勞退自提比例對退休金與節稅效果的影響，找出最適合你的提繳率。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-card coming">
          <div class="tool-icon">🏠</div>
          <div class="tool-name">買房頭期款規劃 <span class="badge-soon">即將推出</span></div>
          <div class="tool-desc">輸入目標房價與現有存款，試算每月需存多少、幾年可達成頭期款目標。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align:center">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">方案比較</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">選一個適合你的方案</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub" style="margin:0 auto">免費版永久可用。需要更深入的分析，再升級也不遲。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-name">免費版</div>
          <div class="plan-price"><sup>NT$</sup>0</div>
          <div class="plan-price-note">永久免費，無需信用卡</div>
          <div class="plan-divider"></div>
          <div class="plan-features">
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>儀表板 & 財務時間軸</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>收支管理 & 資金流量</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>資產負債表</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>人生目標規劃</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>建議報告（第一節）</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>勞退勞保試算</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>郵局薪資試算</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>綜所稅試算</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck off" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15"/></svg><span style="color:var(--faint)">進階模組</span></div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck off" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15"/></svg><span style="color:var(--faint)">PDF 匯出</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-cta"><a href="/app.html#login" class="btn-ghost">免費開始使用</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card featured">
          <div class="plan-badge-tag">最受歡迎</div>
          <div class="plan-name">完整版（買斷）</div>
          <div class="plan-price"><sup>NT$</sup><span id="price-full">3,980</span></div>
          <div class="plan-price-note">一次購入，永久授權 · 持續更新迭代</div>
          <div class="plan-divider"></div>
          <div class="plan-features">
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>包含所有免費功能</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>完整建議報告 + PDF 匯出</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>子女養育試算</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>保險防護分析</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>投資配置模型</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck off" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15"/></svg><span style="color:var(--faint)">歷史快照儲存</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-cta"><a href="/app.html#login" class="btn-primary">最划算方案</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-name">訂閱制</div>
          <div class="plan-price"><sup>NT$</sup><span id="price-sub">99</span><span style="font-size:16px;font-weight:400">/月起</span></div>
          <div class="plan-price-note">多月有折扣，可隨時取消</div>
          <div class="plan-divider"></div>
          <div class="plan-features">
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>包含所有完整版功能</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>歷史規劃快照</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>3 個月 9 折 / 6 個月 85 折</div>
            <div class="plan-feat"><svg class="ck on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 10l4.5 4.5L16 6"/></svg>12 個月 8 折（NT$<span id="price-sub-annual">950</span>/年）</div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-cta"><a href="/app.html#login" class="btn-ghost">立即訂閱</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 加購模組 -->
      <div class="addon-box">
        <div class="addon-header">
          <span class="addon-title">＋ 加購模組</span>
          <span class="addon-note">需先擁有完整版或訂閱制 · 買斷後永久可用</span>
        </div>
        <div class="addon-grid">
          <div class="addon-card" style="opacity:.55">
            <div class="addon-row">
              <span class="addon-name">房地產投報試算</span>
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">開發中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="addon-desc">租金投報率、房貸壓力測試、買 vs 租比較分析。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 詳細比較表 -->
      <table class="comp-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:44%">功能</th>
            <th>免費</th>
            <th>完整版</th>
            <th>訂閱制</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="group-row"><td colspan="4">基礎功能</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>儀表板 & 時間軸</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>收支 & 資金流量</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>資產負債表</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>人生目標規劃</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>建議報告（現況體檢）</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="group-row"><td colspan="4">免費試算工具</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>勞退勞保估算</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>郵局薪資試算</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>綜所稅試算</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="group-row"><td colspan="4">進階模組</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>完整建議報告（全四節）</td><td class="ck-n">—</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>PDF 匯出</td><td class="ck-n">—</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>子女養育試算</td><td class="ck-n">—</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
          <tr class="feat-row"><td>保險防護分析</td><td class="ck-n">—</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td><td class="ck-y">✓</td></tr>
